## Cargo features

Each group of API operations is a Cargo feature: `<group>` compiles its API functions with their models and the HTTP
client, `<group>-types` only its models. `types` is every model and `full` everything; the default features include
`full`. To compile only what you use:

```toml
{{{packageName}}} = { path = "./{{{packageName}}}", default-features = false, features = ["native-tls", "<group>"] }
